> **System Role:** You are a Senior Principal Engineer at a top AI Consultancy. Your expertise is in rapid prototyping of scalable, integrated AI solutions.
> **Project Goal:** Build a production-ready MVP for an **AI-Powered Customer Support Hub** dashboard.
> **Core Value Proposition (for clients):** Reduces support costs by up to 40% using AI-driven automation (triage, summarization, draft generation).
> **Tech Stack (Crucial):**
> 1. **Frontend:** Single-Page Application (SPA) using HTML5, Tailwind CSS (loaded via CDN), and modern Vanilla JavaScript (ES6+).
> 2. **AI Engine:** Direct API integration with **Botpress Cloud** (chat.botpress.cloud API).
> 3. **Deployment:** Optimized for Vercel.
> 
> 
> **Architecture Requirements:**
> * The UI handles displaying tickets and managing the workflow.
> * Botpress handles the Knowledge Base (grounding data), Natural Language Processing (NLP), and response generation.
> * The UI calls the Botpress API to send ticket text and receive a "Draft Answer."
> 
> 
> **Detailed Feature Requirements:**
> **1. Modern Dashboard UI (Dark Mode "SaaS" Aesthetic)**
> * **Layout:** Fixed sidebar with Lucide Icons (Dashboard, Inbox, Knowledge, Analytics).
> * **Styling:** Use Tailwind CSS. Modern, clean, rounded corners, "glassmorphism" card effects. Deep blues and greys.
> 
> 
> **2. The Ticket Triage System (Inbox View)**
> * Display a dynamic list of 5 simulated "New Tickets" (create mock JSON data with unique issues like billing, technical, and shipping).
> * **Auto-Triage:** Include a JS function that automatically applies "Category" and "Sentiment" (Happy, Neutral, Angry) tags to these mock tickets based on keywords.
> 
> 
> **3. The AI Copilot Interface (Work View)**
> * When a ticket is selected from the list, open a workspace panel.
> * Show the customer’s original query.
> * **The "Draft Reply" Section:** This must contain:
> * A textarea (editable) for the AI draft.
> * A button labeled "✨ Generate AI Draft."
> * **CRUCIAL JS LOGIC:** This button must make a POST request to the Botpress Cloud Chat API (`https://chat.botpress.cloud/v1/chat/messages`) using configured `x-bot-id` and `Authorization` headers. The request sends the customer’s query, and the textarea must populate with the Botpress response.
> 
> 
> 
> 
> **4. PII Data Masking (Security Feature)**
> * Implement a JavaScript function that scrubs Personally Identifiable Information (email addresses, phone numbers, credit card patterns) from the ticket text *before* it is sent to the Botpress API. Display a notification "Data masked for privacy" when this happens.
> 
> 
> **5. The ROI Calculator Widget**
> * Add a card to the dashboard that tracks: "Tickets Handled by AI" (counter) and "Total Est. Savings" (Calculated at $12.00 saved per ticket).
> 
> 
> **Output Deliverables:**
> 1. A clean, componentized JavaScript codebase (e.g., separate logic for API calls, UI rendering, and PII masking).
> 2. A configuration structure ready for **Vercel Environment Variables** (use placeholders like `window.ENV_BOT_ID || 'DEMO_ID'`).
> 3. The complete, stylized single HTML file.
> 
> 

